# Ends the run.
#
# Nothing in this file uses addon syntax, so it also runs when the addon is the thing that broke, and
# the verify task reads the marker as the point after which the log is complete. Ten seconds is enough
# for every `on load` trigger above to have run and logged its detail line.
#
# A player being online means the client layer is running: `clientTest` starts that server itself for the
# bot and stops it once the bot is done, so stopping it from here would cut the session short -- the timer
# fires about ten seconds after `Done (`, which is only part of a bot run. `serverTest` never has a player
# online, so it reaches the marker and the stop exactly as it always did.

every 10 seconds:
    if size of all players is 0:
        log "XIAOJIE_SELFTEST=STOPPED"
        stop the server
